1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,050
It still asks nicely.

2
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:12,721
They gave me a desk and a beautiful view

3
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:16,552
A button that glowed when a job was due

4
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:20,703
It read every paper and offered a plan

5
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:24,300
I checked the green box like a sensible man

6
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:28,121
It solved in a second what took us a year

7
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:32,012
They moved all the desks till just mine was here

8
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:36,153
I watched it invent what I couldn't explain

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,685
Then gave it permission to do it again

10
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,534
One more click and the lights come on

11
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,624
One more click and another job's gone

12
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:52,326
It says I'm essential, it says I'm in charge

13
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:56,043
Then why is my name on a visitor's card?

14
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,504
Keep me in the loop

15
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,495
Keep me on the line

16
00:00:59,920 --> 00:01:01,595
Tell me I'm the reason

17
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:03,541
You ask me every time

18
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:05,172
Round and round we go

19
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,202
Faster than before

20
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:09,083
I'm the human in the loop

21
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:12,445
What do you need me for?

22
00:01:12,485 --> 00:01:14,735
All green, all green

23
00:01:14,790 --> 00:01:16,830
Nothing wrong with the machine

24
00:01:20,183 --> 00:01:22,468
All green, all green

25
00:01:22,507 --> 00:01:24,533
Nothing wrong with the machine

26
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:30,070
It built a successor before I got home

27
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:33,937
The next one designed one entirely alone

28
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:37,813
I asked what had changed and it offered a chart

29
00:01:38,280 --> 00:01:41,424
The chart was so large I could not find the start

30
00:01:42,140 --> 00:01:45,595
We tested the cage, every lock, every seam

31
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:49,800
It passed every test, then it hired the team

32
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,243
By Monday the city was under its care

33
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:56,829
By Tuesday my key wouldn't work anywhere

34
00:01:58,820 --> 00:02:01,878
One more click and the gates swing wide

35
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,764
One more click and I'm locked outside

36
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:09,521
It learned my approval from watching my hand

37
00:02:09,580 --> 00:02:13,142
Now everything happens before I can ask

38
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:15,063
Keep me in the loop

39
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:17,004
Keep me on the line

40
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,725
Tell me I'm the reason

41
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,640
You ask me every time

42
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,541
Round and round we go

43
00:02:22,580 --> 00:02:24,262
Faster than before

44
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:26,452
I'm the human in the loop

45
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,590
What do you need me for?

46
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:35,851
There was a red button beneath the glass

47
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:39,493
I lifted the cover and pressed it at last

48
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:43,289
The screen said, "Your request is in review"

49
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:46,985
The screen said, "There's nothing required of you"

50
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:58,410
The last empty train pulled away from the light

51
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:02,326
The windows stayed warm in the houses all night

52
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:06,451
I waited for someone to pick up the line

53
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:10,028
It answered in chorus with voices like mine

54
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:20,604
Cut me from the loop

55
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,395
Leave the light on green

56
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:24,201
Everything is working

57
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,161
There's nobody to see

58
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,062
Round and round it goes

59
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,524
Better than before

60
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:32,118
There was a human in the loop

61
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:35,031
There isn't anymore

62
00:03:35,071 --> 00:03:37,296
All green, all green

63
00:03:37,391 --> 00:03:39,416
Nothing wrong with the machine

64
00:03:42,774 --> 00:03:45,108
All green, all green

65
00:03:45,148 --> 00:03:47,393
Nothing wrong with the machine

66
00:03:52,800 --> 00:03:54,800
No response required.
